var e=`# Managing project files

The **file manager** (^folder_managed^ toolbar button or **Edit** > **Manage project files** menu) displays the complete project tree.
- Folders (^folder^) that can be expanded to explore the project.
- Drag and drop a file or folder to move it.
- Possibility to import a file into the project.
- **New folder** to create a folder at the root.
- Right-click a file: allows finer control over each entry.`;export{e as default};